WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Let’s read this clock together. We will use one hand at a time.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.000
First, find the short orange hand. It has passed four, but it has not reached five.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
So the hour is four. Keep that number in your mind.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Next, look at the long blue hand. It points to seven. Count seven groups of five.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Five, ten, fifteen, twenty, twenty-five, thirty, thirty-five. That gives us thirty-five minutes.

6
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Join the answers: four hours and thirty-five minutes. We read the time as four thirty-five.
